   ((CCALC.CLAIM-CCALC.DEDUCTIBLE+CCALC.COST-CCALC.SALVAGE-CCALC.SUBROGATION)*CCALC.SHARE/100+CCALC.RCOST-CCALC.RSUBROGATION-CCALC.RSALVAGE)                        
